4:b004:l036","ordinal":184223,"en":"Without having his khan informed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1414:b004:l037","ordinal":184224,"en":"Akshunkar of lion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1414:b004:l038","ordinal":184225,"en":"Knocking and hanging."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1414:b004:l039","ordinal":184226,"en":"Raised by Kuu duck"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l001","ordinal":184227,"en":"He circled back, hovering,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l002","ordinal":184228,"en":"And drew near the Pole Star."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l003","ordinal":184229,"en":"From the falcon once carried"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l004","ordinal":184230,"en":"By his father Manas, the gray wolf,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l005","ordinal":184231,"en":"A bird had been born as a legacy held in trust;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l006","ordinal":184232,"en":"Allah ordained that it should come"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l007","ordinal":184233,"en":"To the young champion, the noble lord’s son."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l008","ordinal":184234,"en":"When loosed, that champion was his treasure,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l009","ordinal":184235,"en":"The treasure left as a gift"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l010","ordinal":184236,"en":"By valiant Manas, the gray wolf!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l011","ordinal":184237,"en":"It had utterly torn apart"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l012","ordinal":184238,"en":"The breast and chest,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l013","ordinal":184239,"en":"And feasted to its heart’s content"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l014","ordinal":184240,"en":"Upon the dark flesh of the breast."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l015","ordinal":184241,"en":"Your noble Akshumkar"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l016","ordinal":184242,"en":"Flashed beneath the moon in the sky,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l017","ordinal":184243,"en":"Lifting the wild duck,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l018","ordinal":184244,"en":"And came down from the sky in triumph,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l019","ordinal":184245,"en":"Crying out loudly!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l020","ordinal":184246,"en":"His eyes beheld the falcon,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l021","ordinal":184247,"en":"The accursed wild duck"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l022","ordinal":184248,"en":"That Akshumkar had snatched and brought;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l023","ordinal":184249,"en":"His uncle, old Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l024","ordinal":184250,"en":"Saw it coming with his own eyes!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l025","ordinal":184251,"en":"“My beloved Akshumkar,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l026","ordinal":184252,"en":"May aged Bakai circle in devotion"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l027","ordinal":184253,"en":"Around a champion like you!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l028","ordinal":184254,"en":"Merely seeing you leaves my heart content;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l029","ordinal":184255,"en":"Apart from you, my champion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l030","ordinal":184256,"en":"I possess no treasure—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l031","ordinal":184257,"en":"From your eyes like black currants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l032","ordinal":184258,"en":"From you who caught the wild duck!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l033","ordinal":184259,"en":"Now that I, Bakai, am old,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l034","ordinal":184260,"en":"My beloved Akshumkar,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l035","ordinal":184261,"en":"May I be your sacrifice!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l036","ordinal":184262,"en":"Rejoicing, Khan Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l037","ordinal":184263,"en":"Swiftly invoked Babedin,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l038","ordinal":184264,"en":"Promised a sheep to Koroson,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b003:l039","ordinal":184265,"en":"And before Allah Most High, the One,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l001","ordinal":184266,"en":"Also spoke the vow of Aituyak."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l002","ordinal":184267,"en":"All his longing subsided;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l003","ordinal":184268,"en":"Your uncle and Semetey"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l004","ordinal":184269,"en":"Had their eyes opened wide as umach,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l005","ordinal":184270,"en":"And all their sorrow subsided."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l006","ordinal":184271,"en":"Near the forked pass,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l007","ordinal":184272,"en":"To the high, level upland,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l008","ordinal":184273,"en":"To the level ground covered in fescue,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l009","ordinal":184274,"en":"To lovely Kara-Kyya,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l010","ordinal":184275,"en":"They turned aside to camp."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l011","ordinal":184276,"en":"For your aged uncle Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l012","ordinal":184277,"en":"They sliced rump meat and served mane-fat;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l013","ordinal":184278,"en":"Without delay they had him begin his tale."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l014","ordinal":184279,"en":"For valiant old Bakai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l015","ordinal":184280,"en":"They had a fattened lamb and sweet head"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l016","ordinal":184281,"en":"Boiled into bor."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l017","ordinal":184282,"en":"They heaped up sugar like snow"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l018","ordinal":184283,"en":"And scooped out yellow butter."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l019","ordinal":184284,"en":"They served a thousand and one kinds of food,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l020","ordinal":184285,"en":"Plunging their elder uncle Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l021","ordinal":184286,"en":"Into every kind of pleasure;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l022","ordinal":184287,"en":"The luxuriant turf and clean ground"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l023","ordinal":184288,"en":"Pleased the gray-wolf hero."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l024","ordinal":184289,"en":"They had him begin tales of every kind,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l025","ordinal":184290,"en":"And gave their poor uncle Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l026","ordinal":184291,"en":"A Bayandos pillow upon which to rest."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l027","ordinal":184292,"en":"Their uncle Bakai, your sage,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l028","ordinal":184293,"en":"Now fell into a hero’s sleep."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l029","ordinal":184294,"en":"For the gray wolf born after"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l030","ordinal":184295,"en":"His father, Lord Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l031","ordinal":184296,"en":"There was the Akkangky saddle made by Almambet,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l032","ordinal":184297,"en":"The Kangky saddle fitted for Semetey."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l033","ordinal":184298,"en":"Its front bow was pure gold,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l034","ordinal":184299,"en":"Its rear bow solid silver,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l035","ordinal":184300,"en":"And its two sides broad iron;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l036","ordinal":184301,"en":"It would not shift when ridden downhill."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l037","ordinal":184302,"en":"The splendid hero, the lord’s son,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l038","ordinal":184303,"en":"Rested his head upon Akkangky,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1415:b004:l039","ordinal":184304,"en":"With his head toward the qibla,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l001","ordinal":184305,"en":"Covered himself with Akolpok,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l002","ordinal":184306,"en":"Prayed to the spirit"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l003","ordinal":184307,"en":"Of his father Manas, the gray wolf,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l004","ordinal":184308,"en":"And fell into a hero’s sleep."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l005","ordinal":184309,"en":"They removed the saddles"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l006","ordinal":184310,"en":"From Kökcholok and Taibuurul,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l007","ordinal":184311,"en":"Leaving them bare-backed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l008","ordinal":184312,"en":"And tethered the ancient coursers high."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l009","ordinal":184313,"en":"They lay upon their sides and rested,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l010","ordinal":184314,"en":"Lay down and slept their fill,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l011","ordinal":184315,"en":"Rested propped upon an elbow,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l012","ordinal":184316,"en":"And took a brief doze."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l013","ordinal":184317,"en":"When the time of truthful dawn arrived,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l014","ordinal":184318,"en":"When daybreak turned yellow,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l015","ordinal":184319,"en":"The stars separated above them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1416:b003:l016","ordinal":184320,"en":"And dawn appeared, swelling bright."}]
